00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:09,990
Let's listen to this sentence.

302
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:14,740
He is flying down the ice.

303
00:11:14,740 --> 00:11:17,560
He is flying down the ice.

304
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:20,060
Now we heard the sentence, he is flying down the ice.

305
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:21,040
Right?

306
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,320
Now this one is in progressive.

307
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:23,020
Yeah.

308
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:23,640
Why is that?

309
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:28,620
Well, first of all, when we say he's flying down the ice, it's not that he's literally flying.

310
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:29,880
No, he's not an airplane.

311
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:32,280
He's just skating really fast.

312
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,720
Right?

313
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:38,040
So we kind of exaggerate and we say, oh, he's flying down the ice.

314
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,000
But he's actually skating.

315
00:11:39,780 --> 00:11:41,400
So this is a progressive action.

316
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:42,440
He is doing it.

317
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:45,000
It's happening for more than one second.

318
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,320
Yeah.

319
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,320
Exactly.

320
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:51,380
So that's why we would say, he is flying down the ice instead of he flies down the ice.

321
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:52,760
Yes.

322
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,760
Right?

323
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:55,760
He's skating really, really, really fast.

324
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:56,760
Yeah.

325
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:57,760
Okay.

326
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,760
Okay.

327
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:04,720
So here we see that sometimes in English, we do use present simple to talk about what's happening now.

328
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,720
Right?

329
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:11,080
When it happens really, really quickly or when we want to show that it's really exciting.

330
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:11,350
Exactly.

331
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,080
Yeah.

332
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,150
Makes it much more exciting if we just use the present simple.

333
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:16,640
